  "job_B15.8.614_20260920_210345": {
    "text": "\u00c6rest of cranmerc on \u00feone \u00f0orn.\nOf \u00f0am \u00f0orne andlang str\u00e6t on \u00feonne blacan pyt.\nOf \u00f0am blacan pytte on \u00f0a str\u00e6t, andlang strete on stodfald.\nOf \u00f0am stodfalde on \u00feone litlan broc, andlang broces on blacan mere.\nOf blacan mere on \u00fe\u00e6t sl\u00e6d, andlang sl\u00e6des on blacan mor.\nOf \u00feam more on \u00feet sl\u00e6d, andlang sl\u00e6des \u00fe hit cym\u00f0 on eardes treow.\nOf \u00feam treowe on \u00f0a sealt str\u00e6t, andlang \u00feere salt strete on wilmanford.\nOf wilmanforde on earnes hlewe.\nOf earnes hlewe on Cyneuer\u00f0\u00e6s pyt.\nOf Cyneuer\u00f0\u00e6s pitte, andlang heafdon on hwitan dic, andlang hwitan dic on \u00f0a holan furh.\nOf \u00f0\u00e6re holan furh \u00fe on \u00feene hricweg.\nAndlang weges on cl\u00e6ih\u00e6ma broc, andlang broces \u00fe eft on cranmere.",
